[make 2] -> 2 [drop 2] | the default made once, used, dropped at the statement's end
[make 6] -> 6 [drop 6] | a literal given: made once, the default never
[make 4] -> 4 [drop 4] | a variable lent: the default never made
[make 3] [drop 3] -> 3 | by value: made at the call, dropped by the callee
[make 2] [drop 2] -> 2 | by value, a literal given
[make 4] -> 14 [drop 4] | a default after an argument given
[make 1] [make 2] -> 3 [drop 2] [drop 1] | two defaults: newest dropped first
[make 4] [make 2] -> 6 [drop 2] [drop 4] | one given, one defaulted
[make 2] -> 2 [drop 2] [make 2] -> 2 [drop 2] [make 2] -> 2 [drop 2] | each pass of a loop
[make 2] -> 2 [drop 2] | a result that borrows from it, read within the statement
-> 5 -> 3 -> 3 | String and cstr
